  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEF funds for displacement on Colombia - Venezuela border 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Corporacion Diocesana de Pastoral Social (Caritas Colombia) and the Diocese of Cucuta will response to up to 360 displaced families in displacement centres in Cucuta and Villa del Rosario.  The response will focus on food distribution of dry rations and prepared meal, distribution of hygiene and education kits, as well as basic household items.  Psychosocial support will also be provided to the affected families between  15th September and 15th November</narrative>
  </description>
